<http://data.silknow.org/object/1f17e63d-f596-31e6-b42d-2069df9bd410>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Pale green-gray silk. Gauze weave, with pattern made by extra warps and wefts in fancy bindings. Longs, free warp floats on reverse. Shows a large onion-shaped motif with foliage issuing from the top. Narrow borders along sides and between repeats of pattern, showing quatrefoils on diaper ground. A number of small brown stains."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/a1da901c-c088-3403-8b4d-04986426ae7b> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Pale green-gray silk. Gauze weave, with pattern made by extra warps and wefts in fancy bindings. Longs, free warp floats on reverse. Shows a large onion-shaped motif with foliage issuing from the top. Narrow borders along sides and between repeats of pattern, showing quatrefoils on diaper ground. A number of small brown stains."@en ;
